---
description: >-
  Mixed participant types (actor, plain participant, boundary, control,
  database) with labels of varying line counts, including a three-line
  actor label, under the neo look -- checks that lifelines share a common
  start/end baseline despite differing label heights.
config:
  theme: redux-color
  look: neo
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Multi<br/>line<br/>actor
  participant P as Plain
  participant B@{ "type" : "boundary" } as Single
  participant C@{ "type" : "control" } as Two<br/>lines
  participant DB@{ "type" : "database" } as Database
  U ->> P: the lifelines should share one start
  P ->> DB: and one end
